<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges down to 4.5615 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges down to 4.5615 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged down to 4.5615 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.561 on July 29.</p>
<p>				   July 30    July 29</p>
<p> lei per dollar		4.5615     4.561</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	   100,000    580,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
